# Mana Crypt's upkeep trigger flips a coin; the flip is a two-sided die and the script fixes it to face 1, a won flip, so
# Mana Crypt deals no damage to Bot1 in the upkeep of turn 3. (Face 2 is a lost flip: 3 damage.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mana Crypt
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Dice]
1

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mana Crypt.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
